  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/03/ConferenciaJaumeColl1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>(12 fotos) La vesprada d&#39;aquest dijous s&#39;ha fet al sal&oacute; d&#39;actes del Museu del Taulell &#39;Manolo Safont&#39; d&#39;Onda la segona confer&egrave;ncia dins dels actes del seu 50&egrave; aniversari, a c&agrave;rrec de Jaume Coll Conesa, director del Museu Nacional de Cer&agrave;mica i de les Arts Suntu&agrave;ries &#39;Gonz&aacute;lez Mart&iacute;&#39; de Val&egrave;ncia, sobre La taulelleria medieval a la Pen&iacute;nsula Ib&egrave;rica. De l&#39;abstracci&oacute; religiosa a l&#39;evocaci&oacute; del poder.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciajaumecollmuseu/img_1942.jpg\" alt=\"img_1942\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciajaumecollmuseu/img_1944.jpg\" alt=\"img_1944\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciajaumecollmuseu/img_1945.jpg\" alt=\"img_1945\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciajaumecollmuseu/img_1947.jpg\" alt=\"img_1947\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciajaumecollmuseu/img_1949.jpg\" alt=\"img_1949\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciajaumecollmuseu/img_1953.jpg\" alt=\"img_1953\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenciajaumecollmuseu/img_1954.jpg\" alt=\"img_1954\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/conferenci